---
// src/components/landing/Faq.astro
---

<section id="faq" class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#09090b] border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 transition-colors no-print">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-medium">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="divide-y divide-neutral-200 dark:divide-neutral-800 border-y border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Is Quote Generator Free truly 100% free?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes! You can create, preview, and download unlimited quotations and estimates completely free of charge. There are no subscriptions, no credit cards required, and no hidden paywalls.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Do I need to create an account or log in?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          No registration is required. You can start creating your quotation immediately upon landing on the site. Your active draft is automatically saved in your browser's local storage.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Is my business and client data private?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Absolutely. Unlike traditional online tools that transmit your financial and customer data to remote servers, Quote Generator Free processes and renders your PDFs 100% inside your browser. Nothing is ever sent to or stored on an external database.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          What logo formats are supported?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Our Universal Logo Engine supports PNG, JPG, JPEG, SVG vector graphics, WebP, and GIF. You can also adjust the logo size slider (60px to 220px) and align it to the left, center, or right.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Can I create estimates in different currencies and languages?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes. We support 150+ world currencies (USD, EUR, GBP, CAD, AUD, JPY, INR, CHF, etc.) and multiple languages. The entire website interface can be switched to your preferred language.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="py-4 group">
        <summary class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          Can I save quotes and switch between drafts?
          <span class="text-neutral-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Yes! You can view your saved quotation history in the top toolbar, duplicate existing quotes to make new variations, or reset to start fresh at any time.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
